docs {
  # Product Riset API
  
  Endpoints untuk manajemen product riset (master data).
  
  **Base URL:** `/api/product-riset`
  
  ---
  
  ## Endpoints
  
  | Method | Endpoint | Description | Auth | Role |
  |--------|----------|-------------|------|------|
  | GET | `/` | List product riset dengan pagination | ✅ | All |
  | GET | `/all` | List semua tanpa pagination | ✅ | All |
  | GET | `/:id` | Detail product riset by ID | ✅ | All |
  | POST | `/` | Buat product riset baru | ✅ | Admin |
  | PUT | `/:id` | Update product riset | ✅ | Admin |
  | DELETE | `/:id` | Hapus product riset | ✅ | Admin |
  
  ---
  
  ## Data Model
  
  ```typescript
  interface ProductRiset {
    id: string;        // UUID
    nama_produk: string; // Nama product riset
    createdAt: string; // ISO timestamp
    updatedAt: string; // ISO timestamp
  }
  ```
}
